1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,080
Number 10 santiago de compostela the capital city of the galatia region in northwestern spain santiago de campostella.
第十名是圣地亚哥-德孔波斯特拉，解说称它是西班牙西北部当地地区的首府。

2
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:16,000
Is famous as the final destination of the traditional pilgrimage known as camino de santiago.
它以传统朝圣路线圣雅各之路的终点而闻名。

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:25,270
This pilgrimage is important to many christians because it is believed that santiago de compostela is where saint james an apostle of jesus christ is buried.
这条朝圣路线对许多基督徒很重要，因为相传耶稣基督的使徒圣雅各安葬在这里。

4
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:31,360
Today the city attracts thousands of visitors every year for both its religious tradition and history.
如今，这座城市每年都因宗教传统和历史吸引成千上万的游客。

5
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:36,320
The arriving point for most pilgrims is the main square situated in the heart of the city.
大多数朝圣者抵达的是位于城市中心的主广场。

6
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:51,450
This bustling plaza is the scene of many important landmarks particularly the santiago cathedral where the tomb of saint james is located.
这个热闹的广场聚集了许多重要地标，尤其是据称设有圣雅各墓的圣地亚哥大教堂。

7
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:38,719
Number nine toledo perched on a mountaintop in central spain toledo served as the spanish capital until the 16 th century.
第九名是托莱多。它坐落在西班牙中部的山顶，曾在十六世纪之前担任西班牙首都。

8
00:01:38,719 --> 00:01:46,480
Because it was inhabited by jews christians and muslims for many centuries the city is sometimes called the city of three cultures.
因为犹太人、基督徒和穆斯林曾在这里生活数百年，这座城市有时被称为三种文化之城。

9
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:53,919
Today toledo is a popular destination for its wealth of historic art and architecture that dates back to the roman empire.
如今，托莱多以丰富的历史艺术和可追溯至罗马帝国时期的建筑而成为热门目的地。

10
00:01:53,919 --> 00:02:11,840
The best thing to do in toledo is to get lost amid the medieval streets and admire the old architecture that includes a stunning cathedral synagogue and mosque.
在托莱多，解说最推荐迷失在中世纪街道间，欣赏古老建筑，包括壮观的教堂、犹太会堂和清真寺。

11
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:11,349
Number eight cordoba cordoba is the capital of the cordoba province in the andalusian region of southern spain.
第八名是科尔多瓦，解说介绍它是西班牙南部安达卢西亚地区科尔多瓦省的省会。

12
00:03:11,359 --> 00:03:21,270
The historic quarter of cordoba is a maze of tiny medieval streets plazas and whitewashed courtyards all situated around the star attraction the mezkita.
科尔多瓦历史街区仿佛迷宫，由中世纪小巷、广场和刷白的庭院组成，围绕着主打景点展开。

13
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:27,920
Initially built as a mosque the mesquita is now a glorious cathedral retaining most of its original architecture.
这座最初作为清真寺修建的建筑，如今是一座宏伟的大教堂，同时保留了大部分原有建筑结构。

14
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:36,680
Its forest of columns topped with islamic style red and white striped arches serves as a reminder of the glory and importance cordoba held in medieval times.
成片立柱顶着伊斯兰风格的红白条纹拱门，让人想起科尔多瓦在中世纪的辉煌与重要地位。

15
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:50,200
Other places of interest include the fortress of the christian monarchs the street of flowers and the old jewish quarter with its charming patios and souvenir shops.
其他景点包括基督教君主城堡、百花巷和旧犹太区，那里有迷人的庭院和纪念品商店。
